---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About + Methodology — Rent Free News" description="How Rent Free News checks a viral claim: archive the post, find the primary source, quote humans with permission, publish the verdict.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>About + how we check</h1>
    <p>We are a media-accountability desk: viral claim on top, primary data below, verdict with what’s still unknown.</p>
    <h2>Method</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Screenshot + archive the viral claim</li>
      <li>Find primary dataset / study / VOD timestamp</li>
      <li>Quote humans with permission (VTubers, researchers, locals) + embed, link back</li>
      <li>Publish verdict: True / Misleading / False / Missing Context + corrections link</li>
    </ol>
    <h2 id="creators">For creators</h2>
    <p>We never re-upload. YouTube/Twitch embeds only, draft shared before publish, author box + follow link. DM “QUOTE ME” with your test timestamp to be featured.</p>
    <h2 id="ethics">Ethics</h2>
    <p>No paid verdicts. Sponsored boxes labeled. See <a href="/advertise/">Advertise</a> and <a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
